    },
    "voice": "produce_events/680200109/6802001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんでって、お祝いに──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6802001090040,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そのために探し回ってたわけ？\r\nそんな青春っぽい展開、求めてないんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/680200109/6802001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6802001090050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "ひとりで喜びを噛みしめたかったのに\r\n……なのに、そんなことされたら──",
    "charAnim1": "cry",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/680200109/6802001090050"
  },
